          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaka me Icrael kede Yekocafati abaka me Juda te wot i Ramot-gilead. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaka me Icrael te kobo baŋ Yekocafati ni, “An aruko boŋo apat acalo dano moro ata, ate wot kede i lweny, ento yin myero iruk rukki me loc.” Abaka me Icrael te ruko boŋo mere apat; gin te wot lweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaka me Curia onwoŋo ociko odoŋe ame loo gadigadi mere ni, “Kur ilweny wunu i kom ŋattoro ocele kadi dwoŋ onyo tidi, cite myero ilweny wunu abaka me Icrael.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Doŋ i kare ame odoŋe aloo gadigadi oneno Yekocafati, gin okobo ni abaka me Icrael ene. Gin te cako lweny kede oko, Yekocafati te mwoco koko oko, Rwot te konye daŋ oko. Obaŋa te miyogi weke oko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pien i kare odoŋe ame loo gadigadi oniaŋ ni en mom obedo abaka me Icrael, gin te doŋ weko ryemo yore oko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento lo moro te telo atero mere bayo ata, te celo abaka me Icrael; atero mere te poto i akina nyonyo geŋo kore kede nyonyo ocele me geŋo kome ame onwoŋo calo pok rec. Abaka te kobbi lo ame onwoŋo aryemo gadigadi mere ni myero lokere dok kede cen pien owane oko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 18:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lweny rik te bedo agwa meicel i nino-nono, abaka me Icrael te bedo jeŋere kene i kom gadigadi mere kun nyime oneno jo Curia tuno otyeno; eka te to oko ame ceŋ apoto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.18.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.18.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
